d plot sizes at Wadeem Gardens?\",\"a\":\"Villa sizes range from 4,628 to 6,358 sq. ft., while plot sizes range from 5,727 to 7,750 sq. ft.\"},{\"q\":\"What payment plans are available at Wadeem Gardens?\",\"a\":\"Wadeem Gardens offers two payment options: a 45\\/55 plan without finance and a 25\\/75 plan with finance.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the difference between the two Wadeem Gardens payment plans?\",\"a\":\"The 45\\/55 plan is listed without finance, while the 25\\/75 plan is listed with finance and is subject to off-plan mortgage approval.\"},{\"q\":\"When is the handover of Wadeem Gardens?\",\"a\":\"Wadeem Gardens is scheduled for handover in Q2 2031 under the 25\\/75 payment plan.\"},{\"q\":\"Where is Wadeem Gardens located and what is nearby?\",\"a\":\"Wadeem Gardens is located on Saima, with Zayed International Airport approximately 15 minutes away, ADGM 20 minutes, Louvre Museum 23 minutes, and Disneyland 25 minutes.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":null}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-10-21 14:31:36\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-06 11:06:18\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:59;s:7:\"page_id\";i:4;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:26:\"Frequently Asked Questions\";s:5:\"order\";i:10;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:1489:\"{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"What is Wadeem Gardens?\",\"a\":\"Wadeem Gardens is an upcoming villa community by Saima Group on Karachi, Pakistan, featuring three gated villa clusters.\"},{\"q\":\"What types of villas are available at Wadeem Gardens?\",\"a\":\"Wadeem Gardens offers 4-, 5- and 6-bedroom villas with Contemporary Arabic and Modernist fa\\u00e7ades.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the starting price of Wadeem Gardens?\",\"a\":\"Wadeem Gardens starts from AED 8,700,000 for a 4-bedroom villa.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the villa sizes and plot sizes at Wadeem Gardens?\",\"a\":\"Villa sizes range from 4,628 to 6,358 sq. ft., while plot sizes 