(36, 'investment_description', 'investment', 'Investment Description', 'textarea', 'Saima Group offers attractive real estate investment opportunities through its premium residential projects, modern urban lifestyle, and trusted construction quality. With strong demand for quality living in Karachi and beyond, our developments present high-yield opportunities for homebuyers and investors.', '2026-10-20 04:11:47', '2026-11-06 06:37:46'),
