INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `body`, `in_navbar`, `show_in_projects`, `show_in_commercial`, `navbar_order`, `is_published`, `status`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `og_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 'Home', '/', '<p>Saima Builders is one of the names that buyers tracking real estate developers in Karachi encounter early in their search. Saima Builders and Developers, often referred to simply as Saima Group, has operated in Pakistan\'s property market for around four decades. Saima Builders Karachi remains the group\'s core focus, with a portfolio spanning apartments, villas, plots, and mixed-use developments. Saima Group Karachi is therefore best understood as a legacy developer rather than a new entrant, and that distinction matters when comparing options among best builders in Karachi.</p><h2>About Saima Builders and Developers</h2><p>Saima Builders was founded by Saleem Zaki, who established the company in the mid-1980s with a vision to provide quality housing and modern urban communities. The group is now led by Chairman Zeeshan Saleem Zaki, who joined the family business in 1988 and has overseen the delivery of more than 80 residential, commercial, and mixed-use projects. According to the company\'s own disclosures, it has more than 30 additional developments under way across Pakistan.</p><p>For buyers evaluating Saima Group, the relevant point is delivery history. Saima Builders and Developers is not a first-time developer launch. The group\'s record includes completed projects and a continuing pipeline. Saima Builders Karachi therefore benefits from an established sales, construction, and handover system. Saima Group Karachi buyers should still verify documents, but they are not underwriting an unknown builder. Among property developers in Karachi, that track record carries weight.</p><h2>Cities Where Saima Builders Operates</h2><p>Saima Builders Karachi remains the primary market, with projects in North Nazimabad, Gulshan-e-Maymar, Scheme 33, DHA, and near Jinnah International Airport.</p><p>Outside Karachi, Saima Builders has a presence in Hyderabad and Sukkur, reflecting its reach as one of the real estate developers in Pakistan with a multi-city footprint.</p><p>For buyers searching for a Saima project Karachi, the concentration in Karachi is an advantage. The developer knows the city\'s approval routes and demand patterns. Saima Builders Karachi is not a peripheral operator; it builds in established districts. When reviewing Saima projects in Karachi, location depth matters as much as project specifications.</p><h2>Saima Projects in Karachi</h2><p>The following projects represent the current pipeline of Saima Builders\' new projects and ongoing projects in Karachi.</p><h3>Saima Premium Empire</h3><p>Saima Premium Empire is a residential high-rise in Block A, North Nazimabad Town, Karachi Central District. It is listed by the developer as under construction. The project targets buyers who want central Karachi rather than a distant society. Saima Premium Empire therefore has a rental and end-user case that depends on location more than new amenities. Among Saima Builders\' new projects in Karachi, it stands out for its established urban setting.</p><h3>ZSZ Midtown Farms</h3><p>ZSZ Midtown Farms is one of the group\'s most ambitious upcoming projects, spanning 390 acres of residential development. It is positioned as a large-scale community and reflects the developer\'s ability to execute master-planned environments. For buyers comparing Saima Premium Empire with larger ventures, ZSZ Midtown Farms offers a different scale and lifestyle proposition. It represents the plotted development format within Saima Builders\' new projects.</p><h3>Saima Center Point</h3><p>Saima Center Point is a landmark mixed-use development on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi Cantt, near Capri Cinema in Saddar. The project is a Ground + 41-floor complex with a shopping mall, parking, and residential apartments. It offers 2- to 4-bedroom residences alongside commercial showrooms. For buyers seeking apartments for sale in Karachi within a mixed-use setting, Center Point demonstrates the developer\'s capability in large-scale urban projects, standing out among Saima\'s new projects in Karachi.</p><h3>Saima Dreams</h3><p>Saima Dreams is a luxury residential project in Scheme 33, featuring G+16 high-rise buildings with 4-, 5-, and 6-room apartments. It is designed for premium living near Main Safoora Chowrangi. Among Saima\'s new projects in Karachi, it competes directly with Saima Premium Empire in the premium apartment segment.</p><h3>Saima One Residency Clifton</h3><p>Saima One Residency in Clifton Block 5 is among the developer\'s most premium upcoming launches, offering sea-facing luxury apartments. It fills a genuine supply gap in one of Karachi\'s most exclusive corridors. As a Saima Builders new project, it represents the premium end of the portfolio.</p><h3>Saima Mangroves</h3><p>Saima Mangroves is a mixed-use waterfront development at Korangi Creek, being developed under a Development Advisory Agreement with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group of Saima Builders. Spanning approximately 40 acres of waterfront land, the master plan envisages over 12 million square feet of built-up area, incorporating residential apartments, commercial offices, and a deluxe hotel. The project\'s launch drew an oversubscribed response, signaling institutional confidence.</p><h3>Saima Shield Towers</h3><p>Saima Shield Towers is a collaborative high-rise residential project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, listed as under construction since June 2021. It spans 1,315,000 square feet and features 4- and 5-bedroom luxury apartments. Residents benefit from a secure gated environment with amenities including a gym, community hall, and standby generators.</p><h3>Saima Arabian Villas</h3><p>Saima Arabian Villas is a delivered gated villa community in North Karachi, representing the developer\'s low-rise and community format. It demonstrates Saima\'s ability to deliver completed, habitable communities, a track record that supports confidence in under-construction Saima Builders\' new projects.</p><h3>Saima Defence Mall and Residency</h3><p>Saima Defence Mall and Residency is a completed mixed-use development located in DHA Phase 1, Karachi. The project features 3-bedroom apartments alongside commercial showrooms, supported by amenities including a modern gymnasium, an in-house mosque, a coffee shop, and electricity backup. As completed stock, it serves as tangible evidence of construction quality and handover discipline.</p><h3>Saima Jinnah Icon</h3><p>Saima Jinnah Icon is a mixed-use and residential project in Karachi. It shows the group\'s ability to combine commercial and residential components. Investors reviewing Saima Builders\' ongoing projects in Karachi should note that mixed-use projects carry different leasing and maintenance dynamics compared to pure residential towers.</p><h2>Property Types in the Saima Portfolio</h2><p>Saima Builders offers a range of property formats across its portfolio. The table below maps these offerings to specific Saima projects in Karachi and delivered developments.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Property Types</td><td>Projects</td></tr><tr><td>High-rise residential apartments</td><td>Saima Premium Empire, Saima Dreams, Saima Shield Towers, Saima Center Point</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-rise residential buildings</td><td>Saima Jinnah Icon</td></tr><tr><td>Gated villa and townhouse communities</td><td>Saima Arabian Villas</td></tr><tr><td>Mixed-use commercial and residential developments</td><td>Saima Jinnah Icon, Saima Defence Mall and Residency, Saima Mangroves, Saima Center Point</td></tr><tr><td>Plotted developments</td><td>ZSZ Midtown Farms</td></tr><tr><td>Waterfront and seafront towers</td><td>Saima One Residency Clifton, Saima Mangroves</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>This diversification signals institutional experience. For buyers exploring Saima Builders\' new projects in Karachi, the portfolio spans entry-level apartments to premium seafront towers. Saima Builders\' new projects continue to be launched across these formats, reinforcing the group\'s position among residential and commercial developers in Karachi.</p><h2>Investment Potential</h2><p>Saima Builders offers real estate investment opportunities through its diverse portfolio, established locations, and four decades of delivery history. With growing interest in Karachi\'s premium property segment, the group presents opportunities for investors seeking long-term capital appreciation and rental income.</p><h3>Key Investment Highlights</h3><ul><li>Diverse portfolio spanning high-rise apartments, gated villas, plots, and mixed-use developments</li><li>Developed by Saima Builders and Developers, active since the mid-1980s</li><li>Appeal among end-users and overseas property investors</li><li>Locations across established Karachi districts, including North Nazimabad, DHA, and Clifton</li><li>Potential for long-term capital appreciation in Karachi\'s premium sector</li><li>Lifestyle destinations for families and professionals</li><li>Flexible payment plans across most projects, reducing entry barriers for buyers interested in apartments from Saima Builders Karachi</li><li>Institutional partnerships, including TPL REIT Fund I for Saima Mangroves</li></ul><h2>Location and Coverage: Saima Builders Karachi, Hyderabad, Sukkur</h2><p>Saima Builders operates across Karachi, Hyderabad, and Sukkur, making it one of the established builders in Karachi, Pakistan.</p><p>In Karachi, the group builds in North Nazimabad, Gulshan-e-Maymar, Scheme 33, DHA, and Clifton.</p><p>Outside Karachi, projects include Saima Uptown Sukkur in Sukkur and developments in Hyderabad.</p><p>The group ranks among real estate builders in Karachi, residential developers in Karachi, commercial developers in Karachi, and high-rise builders in Karachi, with towers like Saima Premium Empire and mixed-use projects like Saima Center Point. This multi-city footprint supports its position among builders in Karachi, Pakistan.<br></p>', 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Group Builders | Latest Real Estate Projects in Pakistan', 'Saima Builders & Developers (Saima Group) is one of the Best real estate developers of the Pakistan with 117+ projects across Karachi, Islamabad & many more on', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 07:14:21'),
(2, 'About Us', 'about-us', '<h2>About Saima Real Estate</h2>\r\n<p>Welcome to your trusted source for exploring premier property opportunities on Karachi, Pakistan. We connect discerning homeowners, expatriate residents, and global investors with prestigious master-planned developments built by Saima Group.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Core Services</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Property Advisory:</strong> Practical guidance to help you explore residential and investment opportunities based on your personal budget and lifestyle requirements.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Exclusive Listings:</strong> Full access to premier residential properties, villas, townhouses, and waterfront apartments across Saima.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Market Intelligence:</strong> Transparent, updated information regarding launch dates, construction milestones, payment schedules, and capital appreciation potential.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Mission, Vision & Values</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Our Mission:</strong> To provide accurate property intelligence, honest advisory, and reliable assistance to buyers and investors exploring Abu Dhabi\'s emerging master destinations.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Vision:</strong> To become the leading advisory reference for luxury island real estate in the UAE.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Values:</strong> Accuracy, transparency, and client-first commitment define everything we do.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 2, 1, 'publish', 'About Us – Saima Real Estate', 'Learn more about Saima property opportunities, expert advisory services, and master planning by Saima Group in Abu Dhabi.', 'About saima, Saima Group, Abu Dhabi property advisory', NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-06 04:52:50'),
(3, 'Contact Us', 'contact-us', '<h2>Get in Touch with Our Property Consultants</h2>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Have questions about Saima Builders and Developers projects, payment plans, or property options in Karachi? Our team is ready to guide you and help you find the right property for your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Direct Contact Channels</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Phone & WhatsApp:</strong> +92 332 2495575</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Schedule a Private Consultation</h3>\r\n<p>Fill out the inquiry form on this page or connect with our sales desk to receive official brochures, floor plans, and VIP priority booking.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 3, 1, 'publish', 'Contact Us', 'Get in touch with luxury property advisors for Saima Projects', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 05:52:25'),
(4, 'Wadeem Gardens', 'wadeem-gardens', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">zSaima Mangrove Residences is a new benchmark for living in the city’s waterfront. The project is a blend of contemporary design and a tranquil coastal setting. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes and access to major urban destinations.\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">\r\n    Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi is located on the banks of Korangi Creek Road and faces protected mangrove areas. The development offers a lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families inspired by a resort. Furthermore, the area has a peaceful atmosphere, which is away from the noise and hustle of the city center.\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">\r\n    The project is a blend of luxury, convenience, and investment value. Hence, buyers can purchase a high-value waterfront property in one of the upcoming coastal areas of Karachi.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers<br></h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    Saima Group has created this historic waterfront community. It has been providing residential and commercial projects in Karachi for decades now. As such, the investors know that the developer has built quality houses and delivered the project on time.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The developer is mainly interested in contemporary urban design and building design. In addition, <a href=\"https://theleadmarketing.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lead Marketing</a> assists with the project’s sales and advisory services. The firm’s real estate background and investment expertise are applied in each client interaction.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Mangrove Residences NOC</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    Legal security is one of the key factors that property buyers take into consideration for an investment before they actually buy a property. Hence, the developer gathered all the clearances for the project.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Saima Mangrove Residences NOC is approved by the relevant development authorities. The project also meets environmental and construction requirements. Consequently, buyers can invest with increased confidence.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Approval of the documentation provides added security of ownership and future saleability. Also, there is no significant regulatory issue to consider with financial institutions assessing the project.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Mangrove Residences Location</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    The Saima Mangrove Residences Location is in one of the most sought-after waterfront areas in Karachi. The project is located on Korangi Creek Road with direct access to key urban destinations.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    DHA Phase VIII is just a short drive from residents. Moreover, they can also easily reach the Korangi Industrial Area and the Institute of Business Management. So, it’s the perfect location for the working professional and growing family.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    It is surrounded by natural mangrove belts, enhancing overall living conditions. As a result, people can enjoy cleaner air and a picturesque waterfront view all year long.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Mangrove Residences Location Map</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Saima Mangrove Residences Location Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0px 4px 14px; width: 100%; float: right;\" class=\"note-float-right\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Saima Mangrove Residences Location Map shows the great connectivity of the city of Karachi. The development is linked to various business areas, educational institutions, and healthcare facilities by major roads.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The northwestern route connects residents and the commercial corridors of Korangi via Shaheed-e-Millat Road. The south-eastern road, meanwhile, is an easy way to reach DHA Phase VIII and coastal holiday hot spots.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Its strategic location enhances the project’s appeal for its residential appeal. Moreover, it facilitates long-term value growth by enhancing infrastructure development.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Mangrove Residences Floor Plan</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    The Saima Mangrove Residences Floor Plan focuses on comfort, functionality, and waterfront living. All layouts make the best use of natural light, fresh air, and the living areas. There are also lots of big terraces and balconies, as well as well-planned interior spaces.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Room Apartments – Type C</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"3-Room Apartments – Type C Floor Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The 3-room apartment includes 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, a kitchen, lounge, lobby, 2 wardrobes, and a terrace. It also includes a 6′-6″ × 4′ S.BAL.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments – Type B</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"4-Room Apartments – Type B Floor Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The 4-room apartment includes 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, a kitchen, lounge, entrance lobby, wardrobes, and a terrace. The lounge measures 11′-6″ × 21′ and the kitchen measures 7′ × 11′.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartment – Type A</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"5-Room Apartment – Type A Floor Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Type A includes 4 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, 4 W/R, kitchen, lounge, entrance lobby, S-BAL, and terrace. The layout provides spacious bedrooms, a well-planned kitchen, a large lounge, and separate outdoor spaces through the S-BAL and terrace.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments – Type A-1</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC5.png\" alt=\"5-Room Apartments – Type A-1 Floor Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Type A-1 includes 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, a drawing room, proom, kitchen, lounge, entrance lobby, wardrobes, S.BAL, and terrace.<br>\r\n    The drawing room measures 11′ × 13′, while the lounge measures 11′-6″ × 26′. The kitchen measures 11′ × 8′.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments – Type A-2</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC6.png\" alt=\"5-Room Apartments – Type A-2 Floor Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Type A-2 includes 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, a drawing room, proom, kitchen, lounge, entrance lobby, wardrobes, S.BAL, and terrace.<br>\r\n    The drawing room measures 11′ × 13′, while the lounge measures 11′-6″ × 25′. The kitchen measures 11′ × 8′.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments – Type A-3</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC7.png\" alt=\"5-Room Apartments – Type A-3 Floor Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Type A-3 includes 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, a drawing room, proom, kitchen, lounge, entrance lobby, wardrobes, S.BAL, and two terraces.<br>\r\n    The drawing room measures 11′ × 13′, while the lounge measures 11′-6″ × 25′. The kitchen measures 11′ × 8′.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Mangrove Residences Master Plan</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    The Saima Mangrove Residences Master Plan establishes a safe, orderly, and family-friendly community. The community was carefully divided into residential, recreational, and service areas. This planning method will provide privacy and good access to essential facilities.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The development features a secure gated entry system with high-level security and regulated entry points. The lower levels of the project provide for dedicated parking areas to minimize traffic flow within residential areas. Residents also have daily conveniences such as selected commercial outlets.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The central podium serves as the social and recreational centre of the community. It provides residents with access to leisure facilities, landscaped areas, and family amenities. Therefore, the master plan encourages convenience, comfort, and a balanced life for all age groups.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Mangrove Residences Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    The Saima Mangrove Residences Payment Plan is flexible and interest-free, with various categories of apartments available. Purchasers can book their units at a reasonable booking amount and have flexible installment plans. The developer links payments to construction phases, monthly payments, quarterly payments, and possession phases. As a result, buyers will not have to suffer from significant pressure regarding financial management.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Type A – 5-room Apartment</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Type A – 5-room Apartment Payment Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The overall price of Type A apartments is PKR 22,000,000. The buyers pay PKR 850,000 per booking, allocation, confirmation, and start of work. The plan consists of 48 monthly payments of PKR 150,000 and 16 quarterly installments of PKR 150,000. Additionally, the buyers are required to pay the construction milestone charges during the construction period. The total loan amount for this category is PKR 7,400,000.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Type A-1 – 5 Room Apartment</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC9.png\" alt=\"Type A-1 – 5 Room Apartment Payment Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Type A-1 apartments have a total value of PKR 20,000,000. The buyers pay PKR 800,000 on booking, allocation, confirmation, and start of work. Payment terms are 16 quarterly installments of PKR 150,000 and 48 months of PKR 125,000. Payments are made at key stages of construction, through additional milestone payments. The anticipated loan amount is PKR 6,700,000.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Type A-2 – 5 Room Apartment</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC10.png\" alt=\"Type A-2 – 5 Room Apartment Payment Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Type A-2 apartments cost PKR 19,600,000. The buyers pay PKR 750,000 at booking, allocation, confirmation, and the start of work. The developer collects 48 monthly installments of PKR 125,000 and 16 quarterly installments of PKR 150,000. Construction-related payments are required during the development of the project. The expected loan is PKR 6,500,000.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Type A-3 – 5 Rooms Apartment</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC11.png\" alt=\"Type A-3 – 5 Rooms Apartment Payment Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The price of Type A-3 apartments is PKR 21,150,000. During booking, allocation, confirmation, and the start of work, the buyers contribute PKR 850,000. The plan consists of 48 monthly payments of PKR 150,000 and 16 quarterly payments of PKR 150,000. Buyers also make milestone payments while construction is ongoing. The expected loan amount is PKR 7,050,000.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Type B – 4 Rooms Apartment</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Type B – 4 Rooms Apartment Payment Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0px 4px 14px; width: 100%;\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The total cost of Type B apartments is PKR 14,750,000. Buyers pay PKR 500,000 at each stage. There are 48 instalments of PKR 100,000 and 16 quarterly instalments of PKR 125,000. Construction milestone charges are still in effect throughout the project. The anticipated loan value in this category is PKR 4,950,000.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Type C – 3 Rooms Apartment</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n    <img src=\"/TOC13.png\" alt=\"Type C – 3 Rooms Apartment Payment Plan\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    The total price of type C apartments is PKR 11,000,000. Buyers pay PKR 400,000, which is paid by the buyer at the time of booking, allocation, confirmation, and at the start of work. There are 48 monthly installments of PKR 75,000 and 16 quarterly installments of PKR 75,000. Buyers also make payments during the construction process, as part of milestone payments. The anticipated loan amount is PKR 3,900,000.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Mangrove Residences Installation Plan</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    The Saima Mangrove Residences Installation Plan caters to a flexible interest-free installation plan for those who are buying the estate. The developer spreads payments over a term of 36 to 48 months.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Payments are affordable every month during construction. Moreover, quarterly payments facilitate major development milestones. Small milestone payments directly correlate with structural progress.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    This is a good way of managing the cash flow of investors. Thus, purchasers can enjoy financial versatility and a good asset at the same time.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments for Sale in Saima Mangrove Residences</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    Apartments for sale in Saima Mangrove Residences offer homes that meet various lifestyle needs and investment objectives.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Professionals and families looking for modern waterfront living will choose 2 or 3-bedroom apartments. Meanwhile, the four-bedroom homes feature top-of-the-line finishes and more spacious layouts.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    Luxury penthouses overlooking the creek are also a part of this project. This means that buyers have several choices of homes to pick from according to their choices and financial capacity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Facilities and Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n    The gated community offers residents a variety of lifestyle amenities. The development features a swimming pool, modern gymnasium, spa, and wellness areas.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    In addition, the city has a backup power system and a sophisticated RO water filtration plant. Security personnel keep an eye on the project at all times via CCTV and controlled access points.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n    There are also landscaped areas, a children’s play area, and a Jamia mosque. Thus, the dwellers are comfortable and secure in a single spot. For any further information, please get in touch with the <a href=\"https://theleadmarketing.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lead Marketing team.</a>\r\n</p>', 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 'publish', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-30 03:02:08'),
(14, 'Privacy Policy', 'privacy-policy', '<h2>1. Information Collection</h2>\n<p>We collect information when you interact with our website or contact us regarding properties and real estate opportunities on Saima and in Abu Dhabi.</p>\n<p>You may provide information when you submit an enquiry, request property information, or contact our advisory team via phone, email, or WhatsApp.</p>\n\n<h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>\n<p>We use the information we collect to understand your requirements, provide relevant property details, contact you regarding updates, and facilitate viewings and advisory services.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Information Sharing &amp; Disclosure</h2>\n<p>We respect your privacy and take reasonable steps to protect your personal information. We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for marketing purposes.</p>\n\n<h2>4. Data Security &amp; Integrity</h2>\n<p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to help protect your personal information from unauthorized access, use, alteration, or disclosure.</p>\n\n<h2>5. Your Rights &amp; Choices</h2>\n<p>You have the right to request access, correction, or deletion of your personal data held by us, or withdraw consent to receive marketing updates at any time.</p>\n\n<h2>6. Updates to This Policy</h2>\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in legal, regulatory, or operational requirements. Any revisions will be published on this page.</p>\n', 0, 1, 0, 14, 1, 'publish', 'Privacy Policy', 'Read our Privacy Policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you explore our website.', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-06 04:52:50'),
(15, 'Terms & Conditions', 'terms-and-conditions', '<h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>\n<p>By accessing or using this website, you agree to these Terms &amp;amp; Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please stop using the website.</p>\n\n<h2>2. Website Use</h2>\n<p>This website provides general property information and real estate-related services, including information about properties and projects on Saima and across Abu Dhabi. You must use this website lawfully and responsibly.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Property Information</h2>\n<p>Property listings, prices, layouts, specifications, payment plans, availability, and handover dates are provided for general reference only. Property information may change without notice and does not constitute a binding offer or contract.</p>\n\n<h2>4. No Professional Advice</h2>\n<p>The information provided on this website does not constitute legal, financial, tax, investment, or immigration advice. You should conduct your own research and consult qualified professionals.</p>\n\n<h2>5. No Guarantee of Returns</h2>\n<p>No guarantee is provided regarding future property values, rental income, capital appreciation, or investment returns. Past performance of a property or developer does not guarantee future results.</p>\n\n<h2>6. User Responsibilities</h2>\n<p>You are responsible for providing accurate and complete information when submitting enquiries through this website. Unauthorized use or misrepresentation is strictly prohibited.</p>\n\n<h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<p>All text, logos, graphics, images, and content on this website are owned by their respective owners and protected by copyright and intellectual property laws.</p>\n\n<h2>8. Third-Party Links</h2>\n<p>This website may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience only and we do not endorse or take responsibility for third-party content.</p>\n\n<h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<p>We take reasonable steps to provide accurate information, but make no warranties regarding completeness or timeliness. Users should independently verify details before making a decision.</p>\n\n<h2>10. Governing Law</h2>\n<p>These Terms &amp;amp; Conditions shall be governed by the applicable laws and regulations of the United Arab Emirates and the Emirate of Abu Dhabi.</p>\n', 0, 1, 0, 15, 1, 'publish', 'Terms & Conditions – Saima', 'Official terms and conditions for Saima web portal.', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-06 04:52:50'),
(16, 'Disclaimer', 'disclaimer', '<h2>1. General Information Only</h2><p>The content on this website, including information about properties, property descriptions, prices, payment plans, rental yield estimates, project details, and real estate market updates, is provided for general informational purposes only. It does not constitute an offer, solicitation, or recommendation to buy, sell, or invest in any property.</p><h2>2. No Guarantee of Returns, Rental Yield or Appreciation</h2><p>Any rental yield percentage, return on investment (ROI), or capital appreciation figure mentioned on this website is an indicative estimate based on general market information available at the time of publication. It is not a forecast, promise, or guarantee of future performance. Actual returns may vary depending on market conditions, rental demand, tenancy, maintenance charges, property management, location, and the specific property purchased. Past performance of any property, housing society, or developer is not a reliable indicator of future results.</p><h2>3. Not Financial, Legal or Tax Advice</h2><p>Nothing on this website constitutes financial, legal, or tax advice. Property purchases and investments may involve financial risks, legal requirements, taxes, and other costs. You should obtain independent professional advice based on your individual circumstances before making any property or investment decision in Pakistan.</p><h2>4. Developer & Property Information</h2><p>Prices, availability, floor plans, payment plans, property specifications, possession dates, and project details are subject to change without notice. Information may be provided by property developers, builders, housing societies, real estate agents, and other available sources. We recommend verifying the latest property details, prices, payment terms, approvals, and availability directly with the relevant developer or authorized authority before making any commitment.</p><p>Buyers should independently verify the legal status of a property or housing project, including relevant approvals, ownership documents, land title, and applicable requirements from authorities such as the relevant Development Authority, local government, or other competent regulatory body.</p><h2>5. Regulatory Status</h2><p>Information provided on this website is intended for general property and real estate purposes in Pakistan. This website is not a government website and is not affiliated with or operated by any Pakistani government authority. Nothing on this website should be interpreted as official government communication, legal advice, or regulatory approval of any property, project, developer, or housing society.</p><h2>6. Testimonials</h2><p>Client testimonials published on this website reflect the individual experiences of the clients who provided them. Testimonials are not necessarily representative of the experience of every client. Previous client experiences or investment outcomes do not guarantee similar results for others.</p><h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2><p>This website may contain links to third-party websites for your convenience, including property developers, builders, housing societies, and other real estate service providers. We do not endorse and are not responsible for the content, accuracy, availability, or privacy practices of any third-party website. Users should review the relevant terms and policies before relying on information provided by third parties.</p><h2>8. Accuracy of Information</h2><p>We take reasonable care to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date. However, property prices, availability, project details, payment plans, possession dates, legal requirements, and market conditions may change without notice. We make no warranty regarding the completeness or accuracy of the information provided and accept no liability for errors or omissions to the extent permitted by applicable law.</p><p>Users are encouraged to verify all important information independently before making a property purchase, sale, or investment decision.</p><p>See also our Terms & Conditions for further information regarding the use of this website and limitations of liability.</p>', 0, 1, 0, 16, 1, 'publish', 'Disclaimer – Saima', 'Legal disclaimer for property information and floor plans.', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-06 04:52:50'),
(64, 'lahore', 'lahore', '<p>Test content verification</p>', 1, 1, 0, 23, 1, 'publish', 'lahore Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in lahore.', 'lahore, real estate in lahore, properties for sale in lahore', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-27 06:14:02', '2026-11-02 05:29:00'),
(65, 'Karachi', 'karachi', '<h2 style=\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: Outfit, Inter, sans-serif;\">Aapki Web Development Ki Tayari</h2><p style=\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">HTML Seekhna bohot aasan hai. Yeh Web Development ka pehla qadam hai aur is se aap apni website structure tayyar karte hain.</p><ul style=\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><li style=\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">CSS (Cascading Style Sheets)</li><li style=\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">CSS (Cascading Style Sheets)</li><li style=\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">JavaScript (Programming Language)</li></ul>', 1, 1, 0, 24, 1, 'publish', 'Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Karachi.', 'Karachi, real estate in Karachi, properties for sale in Karachi', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-27 06:20:29', '2026-10-30 01:58:23'),
(68, 'Jamshed road number', 'jamshed-road-number', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 26, 1, 'publish', 'Jamshed road number Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Jamshed road number, Karachi.', 'Jamshed road number, real estate in Jamshed road number, properties for sale in Jamshed road number', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-27 07:01:36', '2026-10-30 01:58:41'),
