Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 28, 1, 'publish', 'punjab Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in punjab.', 'punjab, real estate in punjab, properties for sale in punjab', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-30 01:57:40', '2026-10-30 01:57:40');
